# ===== Local data samples and reconnaissance notes =====
# Raw scanner exports, pricing/metadata samples, and recon notes derived from
# them are kept local because real Dragon Shield exports + the notes that quote
# them contain personal collection data (folder names, cards owned, prices paid).
# Narrow paths only — `docs/` itself stays available for committed project docs.
data/samples/
docs/recon/
# Hetzner deploy runbook — kept local (public repo): it carries box-specific
# operational detail (the box's public IP, the SSH/admin-tunnel pattern, and
# co-tenant coexistence internals) not meant for a public repo. The committed,
# IP-clean config-as-code under infra/hetzner/ is the portfolio surface instead.
docs/hetzner-deploy-runbook.md

# Note: keep uv.lock checked in for reproducible builds — do not ignore it.
